#### From mathcomp Require Import all_ssreflect all_algebra. From mathcomp Require Import reals geometry. Set Implicit Arguments. Unset Strict Implicit.Unset Printing Implicit Defensive. Section ArcFAD. Variable R:realType. Variables O A B C D E F:R^2. Hypothesis Hc: on_circle O A /\on_circle O B /\on_circle O C /\on_circle O D /\on_circle O E. Hypothesis Hf: F = intersection_point (seg A E) (seg B C). Hypothesis Hangle_AFE: angle_deg A F E = 63; Hperp_CFD: [< C F D >] = 90. Definition arc P Q := angle_deg P O Q. Lemma arc_sum: arc A F D + arc D F B + arc B F C + arc C F E + arc E F A = 360. Proof. by []. Qed. End ArcFAD.
